    "note": "Eidolon ladder is cumulative: rank E_n grants E_1..E_n. E1 applies jingliu_e1 (critDmg +0.36 for 2 turns after attacking a debuffed/HP-drained foe) and retypes the enhanced-Skill hits to the extra DAMAGE deal labelled 'E1 Tianguan Gate'. E2 applies jingliu_e2 (dmgAll 0.8 to the enhanced state). E3 raises jingliu_spectral critRate 0.5 -> 0.52, Florephemeral Dreamflux 1.8 -> 1.98 and jingliu_moon critDmg 2.2 -> 2.42. E4 raises jingliu_moon critDmg to 3.42. E5 raises Transcendent Flash / Moon On Glacial River 1.5 -> 1.65 and the Moon adjacent multiplier 0.75 -> 0.825. E6 adds resPen:Ice to jingliu_spectral. Fixtures battle one run per rank e0..e6."
